According to a new report from Intel Market Research, the global Test Equipment Repair Services market was valued at USD 3.35 billion in 2025 and is projected to reach USD 4.45 billion by 2034, growing at a robust CAGR of 3.8% during the forecast period (2026–2034). This growth is driven by the increasing demand for precision maintenance, the rapid adoption of IoT enabled services, and stringent regulatory requirements across industries.
