South America’s mining and oil field operations emphasise ruggedness and field service reliability, with local providers collaborating with multinational OEMs to access specialised calibration tools.
Middle East and Africa focus mainly on oil and gas testing assets; downtime equates to substantial revenue loss, prompting service firms to offer secure, high security calibration environments.
